WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.550
This is ours...

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.630
Ours...

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.840
Our Basquash!

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:07.050
Now!

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:11.270
The stones will awaken!

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:12.730
Do it.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:24.530
'CAUSE SLASH SAID SO

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.430
What are you doing?!

00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:30.470
Who do you think I am?

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:31.580
I am the ruler of this land!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:39.670
Dan!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:42.840
Dan!

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.800
Fire!

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.180
Sela! This way!

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:53.300
Sela!

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.560
Navi!

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:01.650
No! Navi!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.220
Wait.

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:05.940
Don't kill him.

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.530
He's mine.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:24.790
I'm sorry, Dan.

00:01:24.790 --> 00:01:26.170
Be safe...

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.550
The tracery of the legend's thunderbolt...

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:34.970
It's the same as the ruins I saw before... That pattern...

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.300
Those ruins were a path... to the moon...

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:42.270
Navi!

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:43.610
What?

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:47.570
That's...

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.700
Dawn?

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:56.730
The morning of the legend...

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.520
The planet is screaming!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:26.280
Alan?

00:02:26.280 --> 00:02:28.570
Princess, what's wrong?

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:32.110
Alan, what is it? Hold on!

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:55.230
It's horrible...

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.470
The legend has only just begun.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:03.520
The gravity of Earthdash and the moon, and the friction of their atmospheres...

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:08.720
...will cause meteor showers, earthquakes, and freak weather... It'll get worse.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:12.380
And after three weeks...

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:23.720
Yan used military force to take control of Skybloom and impose martial law.

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:27.230
Don't worry.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.420
The people will save us.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:31.790
Don't you agree?

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.550
There's no reason why they would.

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:37.430
Striving to hear the voice of the stones, you stopped hearing your people.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:39.390
This is your reward.

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.060
Answer me...

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.250
Princess...

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:51.570
No one's sparing a thought for the imprisoned king.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:03:54.840
It took the people just one night to accept Yan and the military,

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:58.950
welcoming them in the hope that they will protect the country better than the unreliable royal family.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:04.230
Meaning Yan intended to take over Skybloom from the start?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.430
Yes.

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:07.080
And what he wants is...

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.330
My brother?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.630
Missing.

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:16.670
But you shouldn't worry, Coco.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:20.040
He's overcome hurdles again and again.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.510
He'll overcome this one too.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.170
That is, if he's the true legend.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.510
No sign that you've ever undergone reinforcement...

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:37.820
Just how is it that you were able to activate the ultinium ore?

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.580
We'll have to investigate this in more detail.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:49.880
General Manager Yan Harris said he had no more use for Dunk Mask, after all,

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.710
so I can do <i>whatever</i> I like.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:56.510
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.830
Shooting Dan and pulling a coup...

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.310
Stop, Violette.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:01.430
Still!

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.960
Dan's shooting was caused by some confusion in the chain of command.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.230
The soldier who shot him will be punished.

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.680
And it was not a coup.

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.340
This is for the sake of the legend.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.670
It means that Yan was looking at the bigger picture.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:20.650
We weren't able to create a legend.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.760
That's not accurate.

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.990
The legend is something we will create, starting now.

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:30.660
That's...

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.420
A new legend.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:38.740
Thanks to Dan and you three, the ultinium was activated,

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:41.590
and it became possible to synthesize the legend bullet.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.420
Legend bullet?

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:47.530
To put it simply, a powerful explosive.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.060
In a few days we can secure as much as we need.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:55.870
We'll fire the legend bullet from the Moon Cannon,

00:05:55.870 --> 00:06:00.510
which will generate antiphase frequencies that will be used to activate the moon's deeply buried ultinium ore,

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:01.820
and destroy the moon.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.220
That way Earthdash will be saved.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.620
No...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.330
So what will happen to the moon?!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.540
My family... my friends... They'll all be...

00:06:16.650 --> 00:06:17.880
Yan is right.

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:20.530
Citron, what are you saying?

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:22.060
You have family on the moon too!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:25.080
As it is, both Earthdash and the moon are done for.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.990
It's better to sacrifice the smaller number.

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:36.280
Rouge.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:40.770
You were born on Earthdash, so it should make sense to you.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:45.260
You know the moon is decadent, arrogant, and not worthy of existing.

00:06:46.290 --> 00:06:46.900
Yes.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.520
The two of us will convince Violette.

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.040
For the sake of creating the legend.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.180
Thank you, Citron.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.270
Even once Earthdash is saved, I imagine the unrest will continue for a while.

00:06:58.270 --> 00:07:03.510
When that happens, it will fall to Eclipse to calm the people.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:04.060
Yes.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:08.010
No... Eclipse disbanded, didn't it?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.130
Princess...

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.180
Navi...

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:43.660
We figured everyone got to the moon,

00:07:43.660 --> 00:07:49.490
but then Eclipse broke up, and then this princess showed up and she was Alan's big sister,

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.160
and we have no idea what's going on.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:55.070
Although thanks to that we were able to meet up with you guys again.

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:57.210
But with things like this...

00:07:57.210 --> 00:07:59.690
That's exactly why we'll do everything we can do.

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:06.110
Thinking back now, I get the feeling that whole concert was a setup for calling out Dan's basquash.

00:08:06.610 --> 00:08:07.810
Alan said something about that.

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:10.990
She said it has something to do with the ruins being a path to the moon.

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:15.530
I'm gonna head back to Area Zero.

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:19.570
I'll get the parts I need for maintenance on Dangan there, then head for the ruins.

00:08:19.570 --> 00:08:20.210
Miyuki!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.470
Dan is definitely okay.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.880
Fools lead a charmed life, right?

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:25.910
Goes for Navi too.

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:30.060
Got it.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.770
Me and Alan will wait here for Dan, then head for the ruins.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:35.130
We'll take a little detour and do the same!

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:37.810
Take care of things here!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.470
The ruins, huh?

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:44.610
Navi...

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:48.450
Idiot!

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:52.170
How could you stand there and say it was fine to sacrifice the moon?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:53.200
Didn't we explain?

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:54.840
It's so we can create the legend!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.450
Calm down, Violette!

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:58.520
What are you doing?

00:08:58.520 --> 00:08:59.580
No!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.160
Calm down!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:02.160
Let me go!

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:12.690
It was an act?

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:13.530
Jerks.

00:09:14.580 --> 00:09:15.870
Forgive us.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.820
We had to in order to lure Yan into revealing his true plans.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.310
And he could still be listening to us right now.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:23.940
Dan.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.360
We couldn't create it, but I bet Dan can.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.950
Yes. If anyone could...

00:09:30.950 --> 00:09:31.790
Dan.

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.910
Let's rescue Dan.

00:09:33.910 --> 00:09:37.050
Yes. For the sake of the legend, and the future.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.690
But, to rescue him...

00:09:40.120 --> 00:09:41.720
Do we know where he is?

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:48.640
Can't tell from just this data.

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:52.330
Maybe I'll open you up.

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:57.420
Dan JD.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.390
The closest anyone has gotten to becoming the legend.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:07.030
But is that really the truth?

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:10.260
Too many uncertain elements swirl around him.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.030
Are you all right?

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:30.580
We definitely don't have much time left.

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:35.340
But I <i>will</i> bring forth the legend!

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:37.520
Come, let us go forth.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.970
We shall rescue Dunk Mask.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.180
We disbanded, you know.

00:10:41.180 --> 00:10:45.060
True. But disbanding didn't change you three.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.680
You are idols!

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:49.570
Yes!

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.080
Dan. Wait for me.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:53.900
I swear I'll bring you out of there.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.530
Thanks for all your hard work!

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:15.070
Don't mention it.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.000
We never thought Eclipse themselves would show up handing out thank-yous!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:19.720
It really is different seeing you in person!

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:20.880
Pardon me!

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:27.230
Nameless heroes, may the legend stand upon your shoulders.

00:11:27.690 --> 00:11:28.780
Let us go! Fair maidens—

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:29.780
Hurry, Dan!

00:11:41.770 --> 00:11:43.410
The perfect pick.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.210
Dan!

00:11:47.210 --> 00:11:49.670
I'm Dan! Right here!

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:55.590
I'll die, die, die, die, die!

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.930
Ow, ow, ow, die, die, die, die, die!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:01.870
Dan!

00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:05.670
He's not here.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.000
Where's Dan?!

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:11.730
What?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.580
The laboratory?

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:14.610
Yes... Yes...

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:17.570
Professor Thousand... is about to dissect him?

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:18.980
Dissect him...

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:33.470
So then I was swept along underground,

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:36.160
and this way tasty smell lured me to some worksite,

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:39.780
where they're making some raisined parade thing and I got caught!

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:42.070
And then some stuff happened,

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.260
and then there was this other thing, and— hey!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:46.560
Who goes there?

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:47.920
Freeze!

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:56.900
You don't get to eat Dan!

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:57.820
You...

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.840
Get your hands off of Dan!

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:01.280
Dan!

00:13:04.710 --> 00:13:06.700
Get a grip, stupid-head!

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.760
Don't you know I came all that way to see you?!

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:12.960
I was nearly there!

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:17.590
But my investigation so far indicated nothing physically unusual about Dan.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:21.440
Unless he's in a Bigfoot, the legend's power won't... hm?

00:13:22.750 --> 00:13:24.810
Aren't you a little too old for that?

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:27.780
Thought I'd practice a talent f-for when we have a party...

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.230
I'd rein in the cradle-robbing if I were you.

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:34.730
17th group of meteorites, falling. Radii roughly 5 meters.

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:37.990
Estimated impact zone is central Skybloom.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.370
If we follow this waterway...

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.890
Alan!

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.610
Mr. Dan...

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:19.380
Why is this hurdle the one stopping him?

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:22.950
Unless, it's as I feared, and he's <i>not</i> the legend!

00:14:27.310 --> 00:14:28.280
Alan!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:29.820
Princess!

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:37.870
We have calculation results.

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:41.140
The moon and Earthdash will collide in three days!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.030
Mooneyes's power system has been damaged by the gravitational forces.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:50.100
Power down 20 percent.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.080
We don't have time to wait for Dan.

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.420
If it falls to us to create the legend...

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.900
Initiating plan phase five!

00:14:58.900 --> 00:15:00.070
Move quickly on the preparations.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:02.090
I'll give the announcement immediately!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.150
If it falls to us, we have no choice.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:09.160
Dan...

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.120
...wasn't the legend.

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:36.610
He's not breathing!

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:39.660
Come on! Hold on!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:48.910
Princess!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.580
Him...

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.940
Slash.

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:06.190
I am the OCB Board Chairman, Slash Keens.

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:12.260
And I must share a grave truth with all of you on Earthdash and Mooneyes.

00:16:17.670 --> 00:16:21.330
This is the legend of creation passed down from ancient times.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.490
I'm sure many of you have heard it.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.530
<i>Earthdash and the moon were born from the gods' ball game.</i>

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:35.430
<i>And between the two sibling planets, the same stone was divided.</i>

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:40.600
A stone laden with energy, ultinium ore...

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.410
...the lingering remanant of the legend of creation.

00:16:43.620 --> 00:16:46.790
Because those stones repel each other, like the same poles of a magnet do,

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:48.980
the two planets have maintained a safe distance until now.

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:53.470
But with the passing of ages the stones' power weakened,

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:59.360
their mutual gravity shrunk the distance between them, and very soon...

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.570
They will collide.

00:17:04.570 --> 00:17:06.460
C-Collide?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.280
What'll happen to us?

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:08.260
Moron!

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.560
He said collide, so... we collide!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.700
However!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.630
The legend does not end there.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:14.420
Dan...

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.070
Is Dan...?

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:18.070
Get a hold of yourself, Dan!

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:19.910
If you die...

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.420
I can't eat you raw any more!

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.520
Stupid Dan! Wake up!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.400
Hold on!

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:29.120
The stars and planets were born in the gods' ball game.

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.310
In their hour of need, the gods' power saves them.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.760
The giants' power.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:35.720
Did he say giants?

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:37.110
The ones in the legend?

00:17:37.970 --> 00:17:39.880
The great power.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:41.220
The legend.

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.860
The savior in whose hands is the thunderbolt ball.

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.370
The thunderbolt ball from the legend?

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.440
That's...

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:50.460
Bigfoots.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:55.320
Thus, the legend states:

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.160
<i>What will save the planets is again... a ball game.</i>

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.540
Basquash.

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.120
Basquash.

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.380
I get it! Basquash!

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:09.050
It's basquash!

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:10.710
Basquash!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:10.460
Basquash!

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:17.950
Dan.

00:18:21.130 --> 00:18:23.980
What is the world going to do?

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:24.900
Yes.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:30.890
Activate the ultinium ore through basquash, and save Earthdash and the moon!

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.950
<i>That</i> is the power of the legend!

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:40.560
We spent many years developing the Legend Project and have found potential successors to the legend.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.370
Now, those potential successors
 will play in league matches.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:48.170
I hereby convene the Legend League!

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:01.930
Save... the world...

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:06.070
Are you watching?

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.460
Are you listening?

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.760
Know this, all of you whose hands resides the thunderbolt ball—

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:11.360
I am here on the moon!

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.620
Come and play against me!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.660
Run! Soar! Climb every wall!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.320
Come to me!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:25.730
Let's settle this, basquashers!

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:31.680
No...

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:35.180
That's not it... That's not it.

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.470
But if it saves you...

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:59.990
The legend overcomes every hurdle and only becomes brighter.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:02.700
Please, Baaya.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.270
I understand.

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:21.940
It's beating!

